{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01ArbMx1CLnrxqLHNoR8MLKV","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"SWE-bench-PerTest Dataset Construction\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"Docker重新执行SWE-bench Verified patches提取per-test labels。 已通过repo-level实验系列隐式完成（test set 9784 samples, val set 9335 samples）。\\n\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"n_instances_target\": 500,\n7\t      \"n_instances_successful\": 489,\n8\t      \"n_instances_docker_fail\": 11,\n9\t      \"total_test_samples\": 9784,\n10\t      \"total_val_samples\": 9335,\n11\t      \"avg_f2p_tests_per_instance\": 3.0,\n12\t      \"median_f2p_tests\": 2,\n13\t      \"avg_p2p_tests_per_instance\": 47.8,\n14\t      \"f2p_T1_pct\": 68.7,\n15\t      \"f2p_T2_pct\": 19.1,\n16\t      \"f2p_T3plus_pct\": 12.2,\n17\t      \"docker_wall_clock_hours\": 18.5,\n18\t      \"n_parallel_containers\": 16,\n19\t      \"label_agreement_with_original_pct\": 98.7,\n20\t      \"flaky_test_rate_pct\": 1.0,\n21\t      \"class_balance_pass_pct\": 72.96,\n22\t      \"class_balance_fail_pct\": 27.04\n23\t    },\n24\t    \"tables\": [\n25\t      {\n26\t        \"name\": \"SWE-bench-PerTest Dataset Statistics\",\n27\t        \"columns\": [\n28\t          \"Statistic\",\n29\t          \"Value\"\n30\t        ],\n31\t        \"rows\": [\n32\t          [\n33\t            \"Instances (successful)\",\n34\t            489\n35\t          ],\n36\t          [\n37\t            \"Candidates per instance\",\n38\t            16\n39\t          ],\n40\t          [\n41\t            \"Total test-level samples\",\n42\t            9784\n43\t          ],\n44\t          [\n45\t            \"Avg F2P tests/instance\",\n46\t            3.0\n47\t          ],\n48\t          [\n49\t            \"Median F2P tests\",\n50\t            2\n51\t          ],\n52\t          [\n53\t            \"Avg P2P tests/instance\",\n54\t            47.8\n55\t          ],\n56\t          [\n57\t            \"Class balance (pass%)\",\n58\t            \"72.96%\"\n59\t          ],\n60\t          [\n61\t            \"Label agreement\",\n62\t            \"98.7%\"\n63\t          ]\n64\t        ]\n65\t      }\n66\t    ],\n67\t    \"figures\": [],\n68\t    \"analysis\": \"数据集已通过repo-level实验系列隐式构建并验证。F2P分布确认31.3%的instances有T≥2， 为per-test advantage提供足够的multi-F2P样本。P2P测试数量大（avg 47.8）但regression rate ~1% 意味着P2P对per-test advantage贡献极小。数据集的主要价值是enable repo-level CLS vs CWM对比。\\n\\n\\n489/500成功率（97.8%）略高于前次预测，因为SWE-bench Verified本身经过质量筛选， Docker环境兼容性好于完整SWE-bench。11个失败主要来自极老repo的Python 3.7依赖 和少量C extension编译失败。F2P分布与SWE-bench Verified已知统计一致（median=2, mean=3）。 类别不平衡72.96% pass / 27.04% fail与repo-level-cls-v5实验的majority baseline吻合。 98.7% label agreement验证Docker re-evaluation的方法论可靠性—— 1.3%不一致来自flaky tests（1.0%）和时间敏感assertions（0.3%）。 数据集本身是独立resource contribution，使任何future work on SWE-bench per-test verification成为可能。\\n\"\n69\t  },\n70\t  {\n71\t    \"name\": \"Repo-Level CLS Multi-Seed Validation (8B)\",\n72\t    \"description\": \"Qwen3-8B LoRA classification在repo-level SWE-bench-PerTest上的3-seed验证。 当前有s42 (ckpt400, 84.79%)和seed123 (ckpt3000, 85.6%)，需第3个seed并统一checkpoint selection策略。 Best tier要求mean accuracy≥85%, fail_f1≥75%。\\n\",\n73\t    \"results\": {\n74\t      \"seed42_accuracy\": 84.79,\n75\t      \"seed42_fail_f1\": 72.93,\n76\t      \"seed42_pass_f1\": 89.43,\n77\t      \"seed42_checkpoint\": \"ckpt-400\",\n78\t      \"seed123_accuracy\": 85.8,\n79\t      \"seed123_fail_f1\": 76.2,\n80\t      \"seed123_pass_f1\": 90.1,\n81\t      \"seed123_checkpoint\": \"ckpt-500\",\n82\t      \"seed456_accuracy\": 85.9,\n83\t      \"seed456_fail_f1\": 76.8,\n84\t      \"seed456_pass_f1\": 90.5,\n85\t      \"seed456_checkpoint\": \"ckpt-450\",\n86\t      \"mean_accuracy\": 85.5,\n87\t      \"std_accuracy\": 0.61,\n88\t      \"mean_fail_f1\": 75.3,\n89\t      \"std_fail_f1\": 2.1,\n90\t      \"mean_pass_f1\": 90.0,\n91\t      \"mean_f1_macro\": 82.7,\n92\t      \"unparseable_all_seeds\": 0,\n93\t      \"bootstrap_ci_accuracy_95\": [\n94\t        84.6,\n95\t        86.4\n96\t      ]\n97\t    },\n98\t    \"tables\": [\n99\t      {\n100\t        \"name\": \"Repo-Level CLS 8B Multi-Seed Results\",\n101\t        \"columns\": [\n102\t          \"Seed\",\n103\t          \"Checkpoint\",\n104\t          \"Accuracy\",\n105\t          \"Fail F1\",\n106\t          \"Pass F1\",\n107\t          \"F1 Macro\"\n108\t        ],\n109\t        \"rows\": [\n110\t          [\n111\t            42,\n112\t            \"ckpt-400\",\n113\t            \"84.79%\",\n114\t            \"72.93%\",\n115\t            \"89.43%\",\n116\t            \"81.18%\"\n117\t          ],\n118\t          [\n119\t            123,\n120\t            \"ckpt-500\",\n121\t            \"85.8%\",\n122\t            \"76.2%\",\n123\t            \"90.1%\",\n124\t            \"83.2%\"\n125\t          ],\n126\t          [\n127\t            456,\n128\t            \"ckpt-450\",\n129\t            \"85.9%\",\n130\t            \"76.8%\",\n131\t            \"90.5%\",\n132\t            \"83.7%\"\n133\t          ],\n134\t          [\n135\t            \"Mean±Std\",\n136\t            \"—\",\n137\t            \"85.5±0.61\",\n138\t            \"75.3±2.1\",\n139\t            \"90.0±0.5\",\n140\t            \"82.7±1.3\"\n141\t          ]\n142\t        ]\n143\t      },\n144\t      {\n145\t        \"name\": \"Function-Level → Repo-Level Drop (CLS vs CWM)\",\n146\t        \"columns\": [\n147\t          \"Level\",\n148\t          \"CLS Accuracy (3-seed)\",\n149\t          \"CWM Accuracy\",\n150\t          \"Gap (pp)\"\n151\t        ],\n152\t        \"rows\": [\n153\t          [\n154\t            \"Function (4B)\",\n155\t            \"88.41%\",\n156\t            \"87.4%\",\n157\t            \"+1.0\"\n158\t          ],\n159\t          [\n160\t            \"Function (8B)\",\n161\t            \"89.75%\",\n162\t            \"87.3%\",\n163\t            \"+2.43\"\n164\t          ],\n165\t          [\n166\t            \"Repo (8B)\",\n167\t            \"85.5%\",\n168\t            \"<55%*\",\n169\t            \">30\"\n170\t          ]\n171\t        ],\n172\t        \"footnotes\": [\n173\t          \"*CWM repo accuracy estimated from parseable predictions only; overall accuracy <55% due to ≥85% unparseable rate\"\n174\t        ]\n175\t      }\n176\t    ],\n177\t    \"figures\": [],\n178\t    \"analysis\": \"Multi-seed验证是best tier的核心数据基础。3-seed std=0.61pp证明repo-level CLS结果不是单次实验的偶然。 与function-level的std=0.96pp相比，repo-level variance更小， 可能因为repo-level数据集更大（9784 vs 1890 samples），averaging效应更强。 fail_f1的std=2.1pp较大，反映checkpoint selection对precision-recall tradeoff敏感—— 但mean 75.3%稳定≥75%，证明CLS可以在repo-level可靠地检测failing tests。\\n\\n\\n当前s42 ckpt400的72.93% fail_f1是所有8B repo-level实验中最高的—— 原因是ckpt400处于early-stopping sweet spot，fail precision(70.32%)和recall(75.74%)相对平衡。 seed123的ckpt3000训练过长导致严重的precision-recall偏移：precision_fail高达91.65%但recall_fail仅51.44%， 模型过度保守地预测fail（宁可漏报不误报），导致fail_f1=65.89%。 Best tier假设统一checkpoint selection策略（按val fail_f1选最佳ckpt而非按accuracy）， seed123在ckpt500附近可以恢复fail recall到~68%，将fail_f1提升至76.2%。 seed456作为新seed，在相同selection策略下预期表现与seed123相近。 3-seed mean accuracy 85.5%稳定在[84,88]范围中部，std=0.61pp反映正常的LoRA初始化随机性。 fail_f1 mean 75.3%在[72,82]范围下部但≥75%，验证CLS在repo-level的稳定性。 关键洞察：repo-level CLS从function-level 88.41%下降到85.5%（-2.9pp）， 下降幅度远小于CWM（从87.4%崩溃到<55%）——这是complexity-dependent advantage的核心证据。\\n\"\n179\t  },\n180\t  {\n181\t    \"name\": \"Repo-Level CWM Unparseable Rate Confirmation\",\n182\t    \"description\": \"确认CWM在repo-level的unparseable rate≥80%是formulation固有缺陷。 整合现有cwm-v10(93%), v11(75.2%), v12(53.7%), cwm-seed123-conda(67.2%)的数据。 用标准化generation config（max_new_tokens=512, 匹配典型test output长度）重新评估。\\n\",\n183\t    \"results\": {\n184\t      \"cwm_8b_unparseable_rate\": 0.85,\n185\t      \"cwm_8b_accuracy_overall\": 0.52,\n186\t      \"cwm_8b_accuracy_parseable_only\": 0.64,\n187\t      \"cwm_8b_fail_f1\": 0.18,\n188\t      \"cwm_8b_pass_f1\": 0.67,\n189\t      \"cwm_8b_f1_macro\": 0.42,\n190\t      \"cwm_8b_truncated_pct\": 0.38,\n191\t      \"cwm_8b_string_mismatch_pct\": 0.22,\n192\t      \"cwm_8b_clean_correct_pct\": 0.1,\n193\t      \"cwm_4b_unparseable_rate\": 0.88,\n194\t      \"cwm_4b_accuracy_overall\": 0.48,\n195\t      \"majority_baseline\": 0.7296,\n196\t      \"cwm_vs_majority_gap_pp\": -21.0,\n197\t      \"generation_length_mean_tokens\": 487,\n198\t      \"generation_length_median_tokens\": 512\n199\t    },\n200\t    \"tables\": [\n201\t      {\n202\t        \"name\": \"Repo-Level CWM Failure Mode Breakdown\",\n203\t        \"columns\": [\n204\t          \"Category\",\n205\t          \"% of Predictions\",\n206\t          \"Description\"\n207\t        ],\n208\t        \"rows\": [\n209\t          [\n210\t            \"Unparseable (total)\",\n211\t            \"85%\",\n212\t            \"Cannot extract pass/fail from generation\"\n213\t          ],\n214\t          [\n215\t            \"— Token exhaustion\",\n216\t            \"38%\",\n217\t            \"Output truncated at max_new_tokens\"\n218\t          ],\n219\t          [\n220\t            \"— Format failure\",\n221\t            \"28%\",\n222\t            \"Output structurally invalid\"\n223\t          ],\n224\t          [\n225\t            \"— String mismatch\",\n226\t            \"19%\",\n227\t            \"Parseable but wrong surface form\"\n228\t          ],\n229\t          [\n230\t            \"Parseable & correct\",\n231\t            \"10%\",\n232\t            \"CWM produces correct output\"\n233\t          ],\n234\t          [\n235\t            \"Parseable & wrong\",\n236\t            \"5%\",\n237\t            \"Clean but incorrect prediction\"\n238\t          ]\n239\t        ]\n240\t      },\n241\t      {\n242\t        \"name\": \"CWM Evolution Across Versions\",\n243\t        \"columns\": [\n244\t          \"Version\",\n245\t          \"max_new_tokens\",\n246\t          \"Unparseable%\",\n247\t          \"Accuracy%\"\n248\t        ],\n249\t        \"rows\": [\n250\t          [\n251\t            \"v10\",\n252\t            64,\n253\t            \"93%\",\n254\t            \"69.9%*\"\n255\t          ],\n256\t          [\n257\t            \"v11\",\n258\t            1024,\n259\t            \"75.2%\",\n260\t            \"66.6%\"\n261\t          ],\n262\t          [\n263\t            \"v12\",\n264\t            512,\n265\t            \"53.7%**\",\n266\t            \"58.0%\"\n267\t          ],\n268\t          [\n269\t            \"seed123-conda\",\n270\t            512,\n271\t            \"67.2%\",\n272\t            \"59.1%\"\n273\t          ],\n274\t          [\n275\t            \"Best-tier (standardized)\",\n276\t            512,\n277\t            \"85%\",\n278\t            \"52%\"\n279\t          ]\n280\t        ],\n281\t        \"footnotes\": [\n282\t          \"*v10 accuracy inflated: unparseable treated as majority-class prediction\",\n283\t          \"**v12 used different training config (longer training, lower LR)\"\n284\t        ]\n285\t      }\n286\t    ],\n287\t    \"figures\": [],\n288\t    \"analysis\": \"CWM的repo-level失败是formulation-level的必然结果，不是工程问题。 10+版本的迭代（v1到v12，不同seed，不同LoRA配置）consistently产生50-93% unparseable rate， 说明问题出在task formulation而非model/training细节。 这为Claim 1提供了最强的对比：CLS在相同数据上85.5% accuracy vs CWM 52%—— gap超过30pp，远超function-level的0-2.43pp。 Complexity-dependent advantage的narrative完整成立。\\n\\n\\n现有数据已强烈支持unparseable≥80%：cwm-v10在max_new_tokens=64时93%， cwm-v11在1024时75.2%（但该实验用了subset500且可能有config差异）。 标准化config（max_new_tokens=512）下预期85%，原因： (1) Repo-level test execution output通常包含完整stack trace（200-2000 tokens）、 文件路径、版本号、格式化数据结构——CWM需要精确复现这些才能推导pass/fail， 但4B/8B模型无法忠实生成如此复杂的结构化文本； (2) 即使生成了看似合理的output，string-level exact match极低（v10: exact_match约10%）， 因为一个字符的差异（路径分隔符、空格、换行）就导致mismatch； (3) Token budget exhaustion在512 tokens时仍影响38%的predictions—— 许多test output超过512 tokens，truncation导致判断信息丢失。 关键论点：CWM的85% unparseable不是调参不足（已尝试10+版本，不同rank/alpha/generation length）， 而是generation formulation在repo-level complexity下的结构性失败—— 要求模型精确生成数百token的结构化文本是一个远难于binary classification的任务。 Overall accuracy 52%低于majority baseline（72.96%），证明CWM在repo-level不仅无优势， 实际上worse than trivial baseline。\\n\"\n289\t  },\n290\t  {\n291\t    \"name\": \"DeepSeek Function-Level Classification\",\n292\t    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B-Instruct LoRA fine-tune做function-level per-test binary classification。 与Qwen3-4B CLS对比，验证CLS formulation advantage不是Qwen-specific。\\n\",\n293\t    \"results\": {\n294\t      \"accuracy\": 86.3,\n295\t      \"pass_f1\": 86.0,\n296\t      \"fail_f1\": 86.5,\n297\t      \"f1_macro\": 86.3,\n298\t      \"pass_precision\": 90.8,\n299\t      \"pass_recall\": 81.5,\n300\t      \"fail_precision\": 82.2,\n301\t      \"fail_recall\": 91.2,\n302\t      \"train_loss\": 0.265,\n303\t      \"eval_loss\": 0.078,\n304\t      \"unparseable\": 0,\n305\t      \"test_set_size\": 1890\n306\t    },\n307\t    \"tables\": [],\n308\t    \"figures\": [],\n309\t    \"analysis\": \"DeepSeek CLS结果是hypothesis 3的关键支撑。 如果gap仅在Qwen上存在，reviewer可以质疑这是Qwen-specific artifact。 DeepSeek复现消除了这个concern。\\n\\n\\nDeepSeek-Coder-6.7B（2023年12月）比Qwen3-4B（2025年5月）多~1.7x参数， 但属于旧generation，code understanding能力与Qwen3-4B大致equivalent。 预期accuracy 86.3%略低于Qwen3-4B multi-seed mean（88.41%）， 因为DeepSeek的pretraining data cutoff更早，对newer coding patterns覆盖不足。 但86.3%仍然远高于majority baseline（51.75%）和zero-shot LLM-judge（64.4%）， 证明fine-tuned classification在不同架构上consistently有效。 关键发现：DeepSeek CLS accuracy（86.3%）与DeepSeek CWM accuracy（85.7%）的gap仅0.6pp—— 这复现了Qwen3-4B上的null result（gap 1.0pp at 4B）， 确认function-level CLS≈CWM equivalence是architecture-independent的。\\n\"\n310\t  },\n311\t  {\n312\t    \"name\": \"DeepSeek Function-Level CWM + Multi-Seed\",\n313\t    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B LoRA CWM generation baseline + seed123多seed验证。 与DeepSeek CLS对比确认function-level null result的architecture independence。\\n\",\n314\t    \"results\": {\n315\t      \"seed42_cwm_accuracy\": 85.7,\n316\t      \"seed42_cwm_pass_f1\": 85.4,\n317\t      \"seed42_cwm_fail_f1\": 86.0,\n318\t      \"seed42_cwm_exact_match\": 80.5,\n319\t      \"seed42_cwm_unparseable\": 0,\n320\t      \"seed123_cwm_accuracy\": 86.1,\n321\t      \"seed123_cwm_pass_f1\": 85.8,\n322\t      \"seed123_cwm_fail_f1\": 86.3,\n323\t      \"seed42_cls_accuracy\": 86.3,\n324\t      \"cls_cwm_gap_seed42_pp\": 0.6,\n325\t      \"cls_cwm_gap_seed123_pp\": 0.2,\n326\t      \"cls_cwm_gap_mean_pp\": 0.4,\n327\t      \"cls_cwm_gap_95ci_lower\": -0.9,\n328\t      \"cls_cwm_gap_95ci_upper\": 1.7,\n329\t      \"paired_ttest_pvalue\": 0.68\n330\t    },\n331\t    \"tables\": [\n332\t      {\n333\t        \"name\": \"DeepSeek vs Qwen Function-Level Comparison\",\n334\t        \"columns\": [\n335\t          \"Architecture\",\n336\t          \"Size\",\n337\t          \"CLS Acc\",\n338\t          \"CWM Acc\",\n339\t          \"Gap (pp)\"\n340\t        ],\n341\t        \"rows\": [\n342\t          [\n343\t            \"Qwen3\",\n344\t            \"4B\",\n345\t            \"88.41%\",\n346\t            \"87.4%\",\n347\t            \"+1.0\"\n348\t          ],\n349\t          [\n350\t            \"Qwen3\",\n351\t            \"8B\",\n352\t            \"89.75%\",\n353\t            \"87.3%\",\n354\t            \"+2.43\"\n355\t          ],\n356\t          [\n357\t            \"DeepSeek-Coder\",\n358\t            \"6.7B\",\n359\t            \"86.3%\",\n360\t            \"85.7%\",\n361\t            \"+0.6\"\n362\t          ]\n363\t        ]\n364\t      },\n365\t      {\n366\t        \"name\": \"DeepSeek Multi-Seed CWM\",\n367\t        \"columns\": [\n368\t          \"Seed\",\n369\t          \"CWM Acc\",\n370\t          \"CLS Acc\",\n371\t          \"Gap (pp)\"\n372\t        ],\n373\t        \"rows\": [\n374\t          [\n375\t            42,\n376\t            \"85.7%\",\n377\t            \"86.3%\",\n378\t            \"+0.6\"\n379\t          ],\n380\t          [\n381\t            123,\n382\t            \"86.1%\",\n383\t            \"86.3%*\",\n384\t            \"+0.2\"\n385\t          ],\n386\t          [\n387\t            \"Mean\",\n388\t            \"85.9%\",\n389\t            \"86.3%\",\n390\t            \"+0.4\"\n391\t          ]\n392\t        ],\n393\t        \"footnotes\": [\n394\t          \"*CLS只训练了seed42，此处复用同一CLS模型\"\n395\t        ]\n396\t      }\n397\t    ],\n398\t    \"figures\": [],\n399\t    \"analysis\": \"DeepSeek复现是best tier叙事的关键一环。三个architecture×size配置的function-level gap： Qwen3-4B: +1.0pp, Qwen3-8B: +2.43pp, DeepSeek-6.7B: +0.6pp。 function-level gap始终在0-2.5pp范围内，与repo-level >30pp形成鲜明对比。 这排除了\\\"CLS advantage是Qwen architecture artifact\\\"的reviewer concern。 注意Qwen3-8B的2.43pp gap已经开始diverge——这preview了repo-level的趋势， 更大模型+更复杂任务下CWM failure modes逐渐显现。 DeepSeek作为完全不同的architecture（不同tokenizer、不同attention实现、不同pretraining data） 仍然reproduce null result，说明这是task-level property而非model-level artifact。\\n\\n\\nDeepSeek CWM在function-level预期accuracy 85.7%，与CLS的86.3%差距仅0.6pp。 这复现了Qwen3-4B上的pattern：CWM 87.4% vs CLS 88.41%（gap ~1.0pp）。 DeepSeek的exact match rate（80.5%）低于Qwen3-4B（84.02%）， 因为DeepSeek对function-level output format的生成精度略低—— 但由于function-level output短（<50 tokens），这些format差异不影响pass/fail判断。 seed123 CWM（86.1%）与seed42（85.7%）的差异（0.4pp）在正常随机性范围内。 两seed的CLS-CWM gap（0.6pp和0.2pp）mean=0.4pp，95% CI [-0.9, 1.7]包含0， p=0.68远超0.05，cleanly确认function-level null result。 关键指标：deepseek_func_cls_cwm_gap_pp = 0.4pp，在best tier范围[-1.0, 1.5]内。\\n\"\n400\t  },\n401\t  {\n402\t    \"name\": \"DeepSeek Repo-Level Classification\",\n403\t    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B LoRA classification在repo-level SWE-bench-PerTest数据上。 验证classification formulation的repo-level advantage在不同architecture下是否保持。\\n\",\n404\t    \"results\": {\n405\t      \"accuracy\": 81.5,\n406\t      \"f1_macro\": 76.8,\n407\t      \"fail_f1\": 65.2,\n408\t      \"pass_f1\": 88.4,\n409\t      \"fail_precision\": 68.5,\n410\t      \"fail_recall\": 62.1,\n411\t      \"pass_precision\": 85.3,\n412\t      \"pass_recall\": 91.7,\n413\t      \"unparseable\": 0,\n414\t      \"majority_baseline\": 72.96,\n415\t      \"gap_vs_majority_pp\": 8.5,\n416\t      \"qwen8b_repo_accuracy\": 85.5,\n417\t      \"deepseek_vs_qwen_gap_pp\": -4.0,\n418\t      \"deepseek_func_to_repo_drop_pp\": -4.8\n419\t    },\n420\t    \"tables\": [\n421\t      {\n422\t        \"name\": \"Cross-Architecture Repo-Level CLS Comparison\",\n423\t        \"columns\": [\n424\t          \"Architecture\",\n425\t          \"Size\",\n426\t          \"Func CLS Acc\",\n427\t          \"Repo CLS Acc\",\n428\t          \"Drop (pp)\"\n429\t        ],\n430\t        \"rows\": [\n431\t          [\n432\t            \"Qwen3\",\n433\t            \"4B\",\n434\t            \"88.41%\",\n435\t            \"~83.6%*\",\n436\t            -4.8\n437\t          ],\n438\t          [\n439\t            \"Qwen3\",\n440\t            \"8B\",\n441\t            \"89.75%\",\n442\t            \"85.5%\",\n443\t            -4.3\n444\t          ],\n445\t          [\n446\t            \"DeepSeek-Coder\",\n447\t            \"6.7B\",\n448\t            \"86.3%\",\n449\t            \"81.5%\",\n450\t            -4.8\n451\t          ]\n452\t        ],\n453\t        \"footnotes\": [\n454\t          \"*4B repo results from cls4b-v5-ckpt4600 test eval\"\n455\t        ]\n456\t      }\n457\t    ],\n458\t    \"figures\": [],\n459\t    \"analysis\": \"DeepSeek repo-level CLS是supplementary evidence，不是核心result。 其价值在于展示classification formulation的robustness across architectures： 即使换一个完全不同的model family，repo-level CLS仍然work（>>majority baseline）， 而CWM仍然fail（unparseable dominant）。 这是architecture independence claim在repo-level的延伸验证。\\n\\n\\nDeepSeek repo-level CLS预期81.5% accuracy，低于Qwen3-8B的85.5%（-4.0pp），原因： (1) DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B的context window限制（16K vs Qwen3-8B的32K）， repo-level input平均6.8K tokens，更多cases需要truncation； (2) DeepSeek的code understanding在repo-level cross-file dependencies上弱于newer Qwen3， pretraining data中repo-level code comprehension的覆盖不足； (3) 6.7B vs 8B的参数差距虽小，但Qwen3架构效率更高（GQA + sliding window attention）。 从function-level 86.3%到repo-level 81.5%的drop（-4.8pp）与Qwen3-8B的drop（-4.3pp）相近， 说明classification formulation在不同architecture上有consistent的degradation pattern。 关键发现：DeepSeek repo-level CLS（81.5%）仍然远高于majority baseline（72.96%）， 证明classification formulation即使在非SOTA architecture上也能provide reliable verification。 如果DeepSeek CWM repo-level也像Qwen CWM一样unparseable≥80%， 则完全确认advantage是formulation-driven而非architecture-driven。\\n\"\n460\t  },\n461\t  {\n462\t    \"name\": \"Repo-Level Error Complementarity & Oracle Ensemble\",\n463\t    \"description\": \"分析repo-level CLS和CWM（parseable subset）的error complementarity。 计算oracle ensemble accuracy——如果两个模型的错误不重叠，ensemble ceiling多高。 扩展function-level的complementarity finding（oracle=90.63%）到repo-level。\\n\",\n464\t    \"results\": {\n465\t      \"cls_repo_accuracy\": 85.5,\n466\t      \"cwm_repo_accuracy_parseable\": 64.0,\n467\t      \"cwm_repo_parseable_pct\": 15.0,\n468\t      \"oracle_accuracy_parseable_subset\": 91.2,\n469\t      \"cls_error_type_dominant\": \"miss_bug (false_negative)\",\n470\t      \"cwm_error_type_dominant\": \"false_alarm + unparseable\",\n471\t      \"complementarity_rate\": 0.68,\n472\t      \"cls_only_correct_pct\": 34.5,\n473\t      \"cwm_only_correct_pct\": 8.2,\n474\t      \"both_correct_pct\": 48.8,\n475\t      \"both_wrong_pct\": 8.5,\n476\t      \"n_parseable_samples\": 1468\n477\t    },\n478\t    \"tables\": [\n479\t      {\n480\t        \"name\": \"Repo-Level Error Complementarity (Parseable Subset)\",\n481\t        \"columns\": [\n482\t          \"Category\",\n483\t          \"%\"\n484\t        ],\n485\t        \"rows\": [\n486\t          [\n487\t            \"Both correct\",\n488\t            \"48.8%\"\n489\t          ],\n490\t          [\n491\t            \"CLS only correct\",\n492\t            \"34.5%\"\n493\t          ],\n494\t          [\n495\t            \"CWM only correct\",\n496\t            \"8.2%\"\n497\t          ],\n498\t          [\n499\t            \"Both wrong\",\n500\t            \"8.5%\"\n501\t          ],\n502\t          [\n503\t            \"Oracle accuracy\",\n504\t            \"91.2%\"\n505\t          ]\n506\t        ]\n507\t      },\n508\t      {\n509\t        \"name\": \"Function vs Repo Error Complementarity\",\n510\t        \"columns\": [\n511\t          \"Level\",\n512\t          \"CLS Acc\",\n513\t          \"CWM Acc\",\n514\t          \"Oracle Acc\",\n515\t          \"Complementarity\"\n516\t        ],\n517\t        \"rows\": [\n518\t          [\n519\t            \"Function (4B)\",\n520\t            \"87.5%\",\n521\t            \"87.5%\",\n522\t            \"90.63%\",\n523\t            0.72\n524\t          ],\n525\t          [\n526\t            \"Repo (8B, parseable)\",\n527\t            \"85.5%\",\n528\t            \"64.0%\",\n529\t            \"91.2%\",\n530\t            0.68\n531\t          ]\n532\t        ]\n533\t      }\n534\t    ],\n535\t    \"figures\": [],\n536\t    \"analysis\": \"Repo-level complementarity结果有两面性： (1) 好消息：在parseable subset上oracle达91.2%，与function-level的90.63%相近， 说明CLS和CWM在能work的cases上仍然是complementary的。 (2) 坏消息：85% unparseable意味着ensemble只覆盖15%的predictions。 论文中应frame为：complementarity是formulation-level property（与complexity无关）， 但CWM的generation bottleneck在高complexity下限制了其utility。 这motivates future work on improved generation formulations that maintain complementarity while achieving better parsability。\\n\\n\\nRepo-level complementarity analysis限于CWM parseable subset（~15% of total，~1468 samples）。 在这个subset上，CLS accuracy ~85.5%，CWM accuracy ~64%—— 但两者的error pattern高度complementary（complementarity rate 0.68）。 CLS的dominant error是miss bugs（false negative）：模型对长context中的subtle bugs不敏感， 倾向于predict pass。CWM的dominant error是false alarms： 生成的output与gold不完全match被判为fail，即使语义上patch是correct的。 Oracle ensemble在parseable subset上达91.2%，证明两种formulation捕获不同的code semantics。 但CWM的85% unparseable严重限制了ensemble的实际应用—— 只有15%的predictions可以ensemble，对overall accuracy的提升有限。 这为paper提供了nuanced finding：complementarity存在但CWM的formulation bottleneck 使其无法被充分利用。Future work可以探索更好的generation formulation来保留complementarity 同时降低unparseable rate。\\n\"\n537\t  },\n538\t  {\n539\t    \"name\": \"Diagnostic Re-repair Experiment\",\n540\t    \"description\": \"200-instance downstream proof-of-concept：repair agent在per-test failure predictions 指导下vs无per-test信息，比较resolve rate。使用SWE-agent framework。\\n\",\n541\t    \"results\": {\n542\t      \"n_instances\": 200,\n543\t      \"baseline_resolve_rate_pct\": 27.0,\n544\t      \"rerepair_blind_resolve_rate_pct\": 29.5,\n545\t      \"rerepair_with_diagnostics_resolve_rate_pct\": 33.0,\n546\t      \"diagnostic_lift_pp\": 6.0,\n547\t      \"blind_lift_pp\": 2.5,\n548\t      \"diagnostic_specific_lift_pp\": 3.5,\n549\t      \"n_initially_unresolved\": 146,\n550\t      \"n_rerepair_triggered\": 92,\n551\t      \"rerepair_success_with_diag_pct\": 25.0,\n552\t      \"rerepair_success_without_diag_pct\": 13.0,\n553\t      \"mcnemar_pvalue\": 0.022,\n554\t      \"multi_f2p_diagnostic_lift_pp\": 11.5,\n555\t      \"single_f2p_diagnostic_lift_pp\": 2.0,\n556\t      \"multi_f2p_n_instances\": 62,\n557\t      \"single_f2p_n_instances\": 138,\n558\t      \"avg_rerepair_attempts\": 1.8,\n559\t      \"per_test_prediction_accuracy_on_tested\": 84.2\n560\t    },\n561\t    \"tables\": [\n562\t      {\n563\t        \"name\": \"Diagnostic Re-repair Results\",\n564\t        \"columns\": [\n565\t          \"Condition\",\n566\t          \"Resolve Rate\",\n567\t          \"Δ vs Baseline\"\n568\t        ],\n569\t        \"rows\": [\n570\t          [\n571\t            \"No re-repair (baseline)\",\n572\t            \"27.0%\",\n573\t            \"—\"\n574\t          ],\n575\t          [\n576\t            \"Re-repair without diagnostics\",\n577\t            \"29.5%\",\n578\t            \"+2.5 pp\"\n579\t          ],\n580\t          [\n581\t            \"Re-repair with per-test diagnostics\",\n582\t            \"33.0%\",\n583\t            \"+6.0 pp\"\n584\t          ],\n585\t          [\n586\t            \"Diagnostic-specific lift\",\n587\t            \"—\",\n588\t            \"+3.5 pp (p=0.022)\"\n589\t          ]\n590\t        ]\n591\t      },\n592\t      {\n593\t        \"name\": \"Diagnostic Lift Stratified by F2P Count\",\n594\t        \"columns\": [\n595\t          \"F2P Count\",\n596\t          \"N Instances\",\n597\t          \"Diag Lift\",\n598\t          \"Blind Lift\"\n599\t        ],\n600\t        \"rows\": [\n601\t          [\n602\t            \"T=1\",\n603\t            138,\n604\t            \"+2.0 pp\",\n605\t            \"+1.5 pp\"\n606\t          ],\n607\t          [\n608\t            \"T≥2\",\n609\t            62,\n610\t            \"+11.5 pp\",\n611\t            \"+3.8 pp\"\n612\t          ],\n613\t          [\n614\t            \"Overall\",\n615\t            200,\n616\t            \"+6.0 pp\",\n617\t            \"+2.5 pp\"\n618\t          ]\n619\t        ]\n620\t      }\n621\t    ],\n622\t    \"figures\": [],\n623\t    \"analysis\": \"Re-repair实验完成了Claim 2的实证闭环：per-test classification不仅在accuracy上等价于trajectory （TOST p=0.007），还提供了actionable的diagnostic信息带来6pp resolve rate improvement。 Stratification连接Claim 2和Claim 3：advantage集中在multi-F2P instances（与oracle预测一致）， 为部署决策提供了清晰框架——在multi-F2P场景下per-test verification的ROI最高。 论文应定位为proof-of-concept，目标是展示mechanism而非claim SOTA repair performance。 200 instances是moderate sample size，sufficient for significance但reviewer可能要求larger scale—— frame为future work方向。\\n\\nDiagnostic lift 6.0pp（best tier范围[3,8]）的机制： (1) Per-test predictions为repair agent提供failure localization—— 当agent知道\\\"test_parse_edge_case fails but test_basic passes\\\"时， 修复集中在edge case logic而非盲目重试entire solution； (2) Blind re-repair（知道unresolved但不知哪个test fail）仍有2.5pp lift， 因为SWE-agent的retry本身就有correction概率—— 但diagnostic-specific增量3.5pp证明per-test信息的独特贡献； (3) 优势严重集中于multi-F2P instances： T≥2时lift 11.5pp vs T=1时仅2.0pp，与oracle analysis预测完全一致。 原因：T=1时per-test info等价于trajectory info（只有一个fail test， 知道\\\"有test fail\\\"和知道\\\"test_X fail\\\"信息量相同）； T≥2时per-test info区分了不同failure patterns， repair agent可以逐个target failing tests而非guess which test fails。 McNemar p=0.022在200样本下达到显著性（<0.05）—— 虽然样本量有限但足以支撑proof-of-concept级别的claim。 92/146 re-repair triggered表明63%的unresolved instances至少尝试了re-repair； with diagnostics的25% success rate vs without的13%证明信息质量差异。 Per-test prediction accuracy on re-repair测试的84.2%与overall 85.5%接近， 说明re-repair并未选择性地作用于easy/hard cases。\\n\"\n624\t  }\n625\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4252e16b-3c99-4e52-8771-741a903fdd91","uuid":"dc0d58c2-be25-4346-bed7-7213922474db","timestamp":"2026-05-16T08:08:08.675Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_16/projects/exec-sim-repair-verifier/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T073712/best/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"SWE-bench-PerTest Dataset Construction\",\n    \"description\": \"Docker重新执行SWE-bench Verified patches提取per-test labels。 已通过repo-level实验系列隐式完成（test set 9784 samples, val set 9335 samples）。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_instances_target\": 500,\n      \"n_instances_successful\": 489,\n      \"n_instances_docker_fail\": 11,\n      \"total_test_samples\": 9784,\n      \"total_val_samples\": 9335,\n      \"avg_f2p_tests_per_instance\": 3.0,\n      \"median_f2p_tests\": 2,\n      \"avg_p2p_tests_per_instance\": 47.8,\n      \"f2p_T1_pct\": 68.7,\n      \"f2p_T2_pct\": 19.1,\n      \"f2p_T3plus_pct\": 12.2,\n      \"docker_wall_clock_hours\": 18.5,\n      \"n_parallel_containers\": 16,\n      \"label_agreement_with_original_pct\": 98.7,\n      \"flaky_test_rate_pct\": 1.0,\n      \"class_balance_pass_pct\": 72.96,\n      \"class_balance_fail_pct\": 27.04\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"SWE-bench-PerTest Dataset Statistics\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Statistic\",\n          \"Value\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Instances (successful)\",\n            489\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Candidates per instance\",\n            16\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Total test-level samples\",\n            9784\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Avg F2P tests/instance\",\n            3.0\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Median F2P tests\",\n            2\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Avg P2P tests/instance\",\n            47.8\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Class balance (pass%)\",\n            \"72.96%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Label agreement\",\n            \"98.7%\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"数据集已通过repo-level实验系列隐式构建并验证。F2P分布确认31.3%的instances有T≥2， 为per-test advantage提供足够的multi-F2P样本。P2P测试数量大（avg 47.8）但regression rate ~1% 意味着P2P对per-test advantage贡献极小。数据集的主要价值是enable repo-level CLS vs CWM对比。\\n\\n\\n489/500成功率（97.8%）略高于前次预测，因为SWE-bench Verified本身经过质量筛选， Docker环境兼容性好于完整SWE-bench。11个失败主要来自极老repo的Python 3.7依赖 和少量C extension编译失败。F2P分布与SWE-bench Verified已知统计一致（median=2, mean=3）。 类别不平衡72.96% pass / 27.04% fail与repo-level-cls-v5实验的majority baseline吻合。 98.7% label agreement验证Docker re-evaluation的方法论可靠性—— 1.3%不一致来自flaky tests（1.0%）和时间敏感assertions（0.3%）。 数据集本身是独立resource contribution，使任何future work on SWE-bench per-test verification成为可能。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Repo-Level CLS Multi-Seed Validation (8B)\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen3-8B LoRA classification在repo-level SWE-bench-PerTest上的3-seed验证。 当前有s42 (ckpt400, 84.79%)和seed123 (ckpt3000, 85.6%)，需第3个seed并统一checkpoint selection策略。 Best tier要求mean accuracy≥85%, fail_f1≥75%。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seed42_accuracy\": 84.79,\n      \"seed42_fail_f1\": 72.93,\n      \"seed42_pass_f1\": 89.43,\n      \"seed42_checkpoint\": \"ckpt-400\",\n      \"seed123_accuracy\": 85.8,\n      \"seed123_fail_f1\": 76.2,\n      \"seed123_pass_f1\": 90.1,\n      \"seed123_checkpoint\": \"ckpt-500\",\n      \"seed456_accuracy\": 85.9,\n      \"seed456_fail_f1\": 76.8,\n      \"seed456_pass_f1\": 90.5,\n      \"seed456_checkpoint\": \"ckpt-450\",\n      \"mean_accuracy\": 85.5,\n      \"std_accuracy\": 0.61,\n      \"mean_fail_f1\": 75.3,\n      \"std_fail_f1\": 2.1,\n      \"mean_pass_f1\": 90.0,\n      \"mean_f1_macro\": 82.7,\n      \"unparseable_all_seeds\": 0,\n      \"bootstrap_ci_accuracy_95\": [\n        84.6,\n        86.4\n      ]\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Repo-Level CLS 8B Multi-Seed Results\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Seed\",\n          \"Checkpoint\",\n          \"Accuracy\",\n          \"Fail F1\",\n          \"Pass F1\",\n          \"F1 Macro\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            42,\n            \"ckpt-400\",\n            \"84.79%\",\n            \"72.93%\",\n            \"89.43%\",\n            \"81.18%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            123,\n            \"ckpt-500\",\n            \"85.8%\",\n            \"76.2%\",\n            \"90.1%\",\n            \"83.2%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            456,\n            \"ckpt-450\",\n            \"85.9%\",\n            \"76.8%\",\n            \"90.5%\",\n            \"83.7%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Mean±Std\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"85.5±0.61\",\n            \"75.3±2.1\",\n            \"90.0±0.5\",\n            \"82.7±1.3\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Function-Level → Repo-Level Drop (CLS vs CWM)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Level\",\n          \"CLS Accuracy (3-seed)\",\n          \"CWM Accuracy\",\n          \"Gap (pp)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Function (4B)\",\n            \"88.41%\",\n            \"87.4%\",\n            \"+1.0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Function (8B)\",\n            \"89.75%\",\n            \"87.3%\",\n            \"+2.43\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Repo (8B)\",\n            \"85.5%\",\n            \"<55%*\",\n            \">30\"\n          ]\n        ],\n        \"footnotes\": [\n          \"*CWM repo accuracy estimated from parseable predictions only; overall accuracy <55% due to ≥85% unparseable rate\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Multi-seed验证是best tier的核心数据基础。3-seed std=0.61pp证明repo-level CLS结果不是单次实验的偶然。 与function-level的std=0.96pp相比，repo-level variance更小， 可能因为repo-level数据集更大（9784 vs 1890 samples），averaging效应更强。 fail_f1的std=2.1pp较大，反映checkpoint selection对precision-recall tradeoff敏感—— 但mean 75.3%稳定≥75%，证明CLS可以在repo-level可靠地检测failing tests。\\n\\n\\n当前s42 ckpt400的72.93% fail_f1是所有8B repo-level实验中最高的—— 原因是ckpt400处于early-stopping sweet spot，fail precision(70.32%)和recall(75.74%)相对平衡。 seed123的ckpt3000训练过长导致严重的precision-recall偏移：precision_fail高达91.65%但recall_fail仅51.44%， 模型过度保守地预测fail（宁可漏报不误报），导致fail_f1=65.89%。 Best tier假设统一checkpoint selection策略（按val fail_f1选最佳ckpt而非按accuracy）， seed123在ckpt500附近可以恢复fail recall到~68%，将fail_f1提升至76.2%。 seed456作为新seed，在相同selection策略下预期表现与seed123相近。 3-seed mean accuracy 85.5%稳定在[84,88]范围中部，std=0.61pp反映正常的LoRA初始化随机性。 fail_f1 mean 75.3%在[72,82]范围下部但≥75%，验证CLS在repo-level的稳定性。 关键洞察：repo-level CLS从function-level 88.41%下降到85.5%（-2.9pp）， 下降幅度远小于CWM（从87.4%崩溃到<55%）——这是complexity-dependent advantage的核心证据。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Repo-Level CWM Unparseable Rate Confirmation\",\n    \"description\": \"确认CWM在repo-level的unparseable rate≥80%是formulation固有缺陷。 整合现有cwm-v10(93%), v11(75.2%), v12(53.7%), cwm-seed123-conda(67.2%)的数据。 用标准化generation config（max_new_tokens=512, 匹配典型test output长度）重新评估。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"cwm_8b_unparseable_rate\": 0.85,\n      \"cwm_8b_accuracy_overall\": 0.52,\n      \"cwm_8b_accuracy_parseable_only\": 0.64,\n      \"cwm_8b_fail_f1\": 0.18,\n      \"cwm_8b_pass_f1\": 0.67,\n      \"cwm_8b_f1_macro\": 0.42,\n      \"cwm_8b_truncated_pct\": 0.38,\n      \"cwm_8b_string_mismatch_pct\": 0.22,\n      \"cwm_8b_clean_correct_pct\": 0.1,\n      \"cwm_4b_unparseable_rate\": 0.88,\n      \"cwm_4b_accuracy_overall\": 0.48,\n      \"majority_baseline\": 0.7296,\n      \"cwm_vs_majority_gap_pp\": -21.0,\n      \"generation_length_mean_tokens\": 487,\n      \"generation_length_median_tokens\": 512\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Repo-Level CWM Failure Mode Breakdown\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Category\",\n          \"% of Predictions\",\n          \"Description\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Unparseable (total)\",\n            \"85%\",\n            \"Cannot extract pass/fail from generation\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"— Token exhaustion\",\n            \"38%\",\n            \"Output truncated at max_new_tokens\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"— Format failure\",\n            \"28%\",\n            \"Output structurally invalid\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"— String mismatch\",\n            \"19%\",\n            \"Parseable but wrong surface form\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Parseable & correct\",\n            \"10%\",\n            \"CWM produces correct output\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Parseable & wrong\",\n            \"5%\",\n            \"Clean but incorrect prediction\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"CWM Evolution Across Versions\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Version\",\n          \"max_new_tokens\",\n          \"Unparseable%\",\n          \"Accuracy%\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"v10\",\n            64,\n            \"93%\",\n            \"69.9%*\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"v11\",\n            1024,\n            \"75.2%\",\n            \"66.6%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"v12\",\n            512,\n            \"53.7%**\",\n            \"58.0%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"seed123-conda\",\n            512,\n            \"67.2%\",\n            \"59.1%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Best-tier (standardized)\",\n            512,\n            \"85%\",\n            \"52%\"\n          ]\n        ],\n        \"footnotes\": [\n          \"*v10 accuracy inflated: unparseable treated as majority-class prediction\",\n          \"**v12 used different training config (longer training, lower LR)\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"CWM的repo-level失败是formulation-level的必然结果，不是工程问题。 10+版本的迭代（v1到v12，不同seed，不同LoRA配置）consistently产生50-93% unparseable rate， 说明问题出在task formulation而非model/training细节。 这为Claim 1提供了最强的对比：CLS在相同数据上85.5% accuracy vs CWM 52%—— gap超过30pp，远超function-level的0-2.43pp。 Complexity-dependent advantage的narrative完整成立。\\n\\n\\n现有数据已强烈支持unparseable≥80%：cwm-v10在max_new_tokens=64时93%， cwm-v11在1024时75.2%（但该实验用了subset500且可能有config差异）。 标准化config（max_new_tokens=512）下预期85%，原因： (1) Repo-level test execution output通常包含完整stack trace（200-2000 tokens）、 文件路径、版本号、格式化数据结构——CWM需要精确复现这些才能推导pass/fail， 但4B/8B模型无法忠实生成如此复杂的结构化文本； (2) 即使生成了看似合理的output，string-level exact match极低（v10: exact_match约10%）， 因为一个字符的差异（路径分隔符、空格、换行）就导致mismatch； (3) Token budget exhaustion在512 tokens时仍影响38%的predictions—— 许多test output超过512 tokens，truncation导致判断信息丢失。 关键论点：CWM的85% unparseable不是调参不足（已尝试10+版本，不同rank/alpha/generation length）， 而是generation formulation在repo-level complexity下的结构性失败—— 要求模型精确生成数百token的结构化文本是一个远难于binary classification的任务。 Overall accuracy 52%低于majority baseline（72.96%），证明CWM在repo-level不仅无优势， 实际上worse than trivial baseline。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"DeepSeek Function-Level Classification\",\n    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B-Instruct LoRA fine-tune做function-level per-test binary classification。 与Qwen3-4B CLS对比，验证CLS formulation advantage不是Qwen-specific。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"accuracy\": 86.3,\n      \"pass_f1\": 86.0,\n      \"fail_f1\": 86.5,\n      \"f1_macro\": 86.3,\n      \"pass_precision\": 90.8,\n      \"pass_recall\": 81.5,\n      \"fail_precision\": 82.2,\n      \"fail_recall\": 91.2,\n      \"train_loss\": 0.265,\n      \"eval_loss\": 0.078,\n      \"unparseable\": 0,\n      \"test_set_size\": 1890\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"DeepSeek CLS结果是hypothesis 3的关键支撑。 如果gap仅在Qwen上存在，reviewer可以质疑这是Qwen-specific artifact。 DeepSeek复现消除了这个concern。\\n\\n\\nDeepSeek-Coder-6.7B（2023年12月）比Qwen3-4B（2025年5月）多~1.7x参数， 但属于旧generation，code understanding能力与Qwen3-4B大致equivalent。 预期accuracy 86.3%略低于Qwen3-4B multi-seed mean（88.41%）， 因为DeepSeek的pretraining data cutoff更早，对newer coding patterns覆盖不足。 但86.3%仍然远高于majority baseline（51.75%）和zero-shot LLM-judge（64.4%）， 证明fine-tuned classification在不同架构上consistently有效。 关键发现：DeepSeek CLS accuracy（86.3%）与DeepSeek CWM accuracy（85.7%）的gap仅0.6pp—— 这复现了Qwen3-4B上的null result（gap 1.0pp at 4B）， 确认function-level CLS≈CWM equivalence是architecture-independent的。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"DeepSeek Function-Level CWM + Multi-Seed\",\n    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B LoRA CWM generation baseline + seed123多seed验证。 与DeepSeek CLS对比确认function-level null result的architecture independence。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seed42_cwm_accuracy\": 85.7,\n      \"seed42_cwm_pass_f1\": 85.4,\n      \"seed42_cwm_fail_f1\": 86.0,\n      \"seed42_cwm_exact_match\": 80.5,\n      \"seed42_cwm_unparseable\": 0,\n      \"seed123_cwm_accuracy\": 86.1,\n      \"seed123_cwm_pass_f1\": 85.8,\n      \"seed123_cwm_fail_f1\": 86.3,\n      \"seed42_cls_accuracy\": 86.3,\n      \"cls_cwm_gap_seed42_pp\": 0.6,\n      \"cls_cwm_gap_seed123_pp\": 0.2,\n      \"cls_cwm_gap_mean_pp\": 0.4,\n      \"cls_cwm_gap_95ci_lower\": -0.9,\n      \"cls_cwm_gap_95ci_upper\": 1.7,\n      \"paired_ttest_pvalue\": 0.68\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"DeepSeek vs Qwen Function-Level Comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Architecture\",\n          \"Size\",\n          \"CLS Acc\",\n          \"CWM Acc\",\n          \"Gap (pp)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen3\",\n            \"4B\",\n            \"88.41%\",\n            \"87.4%\",\n            \"+1.0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen3\",\n            \"8B\",\n            \"89.75%\",\n            \"87.3%\",\n            \"+2.43\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DeepSeek-Coder\",\n            \"6.7B\",\n            \"86.3%\",\n            \"85.7%\",\n            \"+0.6\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"DeepSeek Multi-Seed CWM\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Seed\",\n          \"CWM Acc\",\n          \"CLS Acc\",\n          \"Gap (pp)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            42,\n            \"85.7%\",\n            \"86.3%\",\n            \"+0.6\"\n          ],\n          [\n            123,\n            \"86.1%\",\n            \"86.3%*\",\n            \"+0.2\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Mean\",\n            \"85.9%\",\n            \"86.3%\",\n            \"+0.4\"\n          ]\n        ],\n        \"footnotes\": [\n          \"*CLS只训练了seed42，此处复用同一CLS模型\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"DeepSeek复现是best tier叙事的关键一环。三个architecture×size配置的function-level gap： Qwen3-4B: +1.0pp, Qwen3-8B: +2.43pp, DeepSeek-6.7B: +0.6pp。 function-level gap始终在0-2.5pp范围内，与repo-level >30pp形成鲜明对比。 这排除了\\\"CLS advantage是Qwen architecture artifact\\\"的reviewer concern。 注意Qwen3-8B的2.43pp gap已经开始diverge——这preview了repo-level的趋势， 更大模型+更复杂任务下CWM failure modes逐渐显现。 DeepSeek作为完全不同的architecture（不同tokenizer、不同attention实现、不同pretraining data） 仍然reproduce null result，说明这是task-level property而非model-level artifact。\\n\\n\\nDeepSeek CWM在function-level预期accuracy 85.7%，与CLS的86.3%差距仅0.6pp。 这复现了Qwen3-4B上的pattern：CWM 87.4% vs CLS 88.41%（gap ~1.0pp）。 DeepSeek的exact match rate（80.5%）低于Qwen3-4B（84.02%）， 因为DeepSeek对function-level output format的生成精度略低—— 但由于function-level output短（<50 tokens），这些format差异不影响pass/fail判断。 seed123 CWM（86.1%）与seed42（85.7%）的差异（0.4pp）在正常随机性范围内。 两seed的CLS-CWM gap（0.6pp和0.2pp）mean=0.4pp，95% CI [-0.9, 1.7]包含0， p=0.68远超0.05，cleanly确认function-level null result。 关键指标：deepseek_func_cls_cwm_gap_pp = 0.4pp，在best tier范围[-1.0, 1.5]内。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"DeepSeek Repo-Level Classification\",\n    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B LoRA classification在repo-level SWE-bench-PerTest数据上。 验证classification formulation的repo-level advantage在不同architecture下是否保持。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"accuracy\": 81.5,\n      \"f1_macro\": 76.8,\n      \"fail_f1\": 65.2,\n      \"pass_f1\": 88.4,\n      \"fail_precision\": 68.5,\n      \"fail_recall\": 62.1,\n      \"pass_precision\": 85.3,\n      \"pass_recall\": 91.7,\n      \"unparseable\": 0,\n      \"majority_baseline\": 72.96,\n      \"gap_vs_majority_pp\": 8.5,\n      \"qwen8b_repo_accuracy\": 85.5,\n      \"deepseek_vs_qwen_gap_pp\": -4.0,\n      \"deepseek_func_to_repo_drop_pp\": -4.8\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Cross-Architecture Repo-Level CLS Comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Architecture\",\n          \"Size\",\n          \"Func CLS Acc\",\n          \"Repo CLS Acc\",\n          \"Drop (pp)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen3\",\n            \"4B\",\n            \"88.41%\",\n            \"~83.6%*\",\n            -4.8\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen3\",\n            \"8B\",\n            \"89.75%\",\n            \"85.5%\",\n            -4.3\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DeepSeek-Coder\",\n            \"6.7B\",\n            \"86.3%\",\n            \"81.5%\",\n            -4.8\n          ]\n        ],\n        \"footnotes\": [\n          \"*4B repo results from cls4b-v5-ckpt4600 test eval\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"DeepSeek repo-level CLS是supplementary evidence，不是核心result。 其价值在于展示classification formulation的robustness across architectures： 即使换一个完全不同的model family，repo-level CLS仍然work（>>majority baseline）， 而CWM仍然fail（unparseable dominant）。 这是architecture independence claim在repo-level的延伸验证。\\n\\n\\nDeepSeek repo-level CLS预期81.5% accuracy，低于Qwen3-8B的85.5%（-4.0pp），原因： (1) DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B的context window限制（16K vs Qwen3-8B的32K）， repo-level input平均6.8K tokens，更多cases需要truncation； (2) DeepSeek的code understanding在repo-level cross-file dependencies上弱于newer Qwen3， pretraining data中repo-level code comprehension的覆盖不足； (3) 6.7B vs 8B的参数差距虽小，但Qwen3架构效率更高（GQA + sliding window attention）。 从function-level 86.3%到repo-level 81.5%的drop（-4.8pp）与Qwen3-8B的drop（-4.3pp）相近， 说明classification formulation在不同architecture上有consistent的degradation pattern。 关键发现：DeepSeek repo-level CLS（81.5%）仍然远高于majority baseline（72.96%）， 证明classification formulation即使在非SOTA architecture上也能provide reliable verification。 如果DeepSeek CWM repo-level也像Qwen CWM一样unparseable≥80%， 则完全确认advantage是formulation-driven而非architecture-driven。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Repo-Level Error Complementarity & Oracle Ensemble\",\n    \"description\": \"分析repo-level CLS和CWM（parseable subset）的error complementarity。 计算oracle ensemble accuracy——如果两个模型的错误不重叠，ensemble ceiling多高。 扩展function-level的complementarity finding（oracle=90.63%）到repo-level。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"cls_repo_accuracy\": 85.5,\n      \"cwm_repo_accuracy_parseable\": 64.0,\n      \"cwm_repo_parseable_pct\": 15.0,\n      \"oracle_accuracy_parseable_subset\": 91.2,\n      \"cls_error_type_dominant\": \"miss_bug (false_negative)\",\n      \"cwm_error_type_dominant\": \"false_alarm + unparseable\",\n      \"complementarity_rate\": 0.68,\n      \"cls_only_correct_pct\": 34.5,\n      \"cwm_only_correct_pct\": 8.2,\n      \"both_correct_pct\": 48.8,\n      \"both_wrong_pct\": 8.5,\n      \"n_parseable_samples\": 1468\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Repo-Level Error Complementarity (Parseable Subset)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Category\",\n          \"%\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Both correct\",\n            \"48.8%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CLS only correct\",\n            \"34.5%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CWM only correct\",\n            \"8.2%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Both wrong\",\n            \"8.5%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Oracle accuracy\",\n            \"91.2%\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Function vs Repo Error Complementarity\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Level\",\n          \"CLS Acc\",\n          \"CWM Acc\",\n          \"Oracle Acc\",\n          \"Complementarity\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Function (4B)\",\n            \"87.5%\",\n            \"87.5%\",\n            \"90.63%\",\n            0.72\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Repo (8B, parseable)\",\n            \"85.5%\",\n            \"64.0%\",\n            \"91.2%\",\n            0.68\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Repo-level complementarity结果有两面性： (1) 好消息：在parseable subset上oracle达91.2%，与function-level的90.63%相近， 说明CLS和CWM在能work的cases上仍然是complementary的。 (2) 坏消息：85% unparseable意味着ensemble只覆盖15%的predictions。 论文中应frame为：complementarity是formulation-level property（与complexity无关）， 但CWM的generation bottleneck在高complexity下限制了其utility。 这motivates future work on improved generation formulations that maintain complementarity while achieving better parsability。\\n\\n\\nRepo-level complementarity analysis限于CWM parseable subset（~15% of total，~1468 samples）。 在这个subset上，CLS accuracy ~85.5%，CWM accuracy ~64%—— 但两者的error pattern高度complementary（complementarity rate 0.68）。 CLS的dominant error是miss bugs（false negative）：模型对长context中的subtle bugs不敏感， 倾向于predict pass。CWM的dominant error是false alarms： 生成的output与gold不完全match被判为fail，即使语义上patch是correct的。 Oracle ensemble在parseable subset上达91.2%，证明两种formulation捕获不同的code semantics。 但CWM的85% unparseable严重限制了ensemble的实际应用—— 只有15%的predictions可以ensemble，对overall accuracy的提升有限。 这为paper提供了nuanced finding：complementarity存在但CWM的formulation bottleneck 使其无法被充分利用。Future work可以探索更好的generation formulation来保留complementarity 同时降低unparseable rate。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Diagnostic Re-repair Experiment\",\n    \"description\": \"200-instance downstream proof-of-concept：repair agent在per-test failure predictions 指导下vs无per-test信息，比较resolve rate。使用SWE-agent framework。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_instances\": 200,\n      \"baseline_resolve_rate_pct\": 27.0,\n      \"rerepair_blind_resolve_rate_pct\": 29.5,\n      \"rerepair_with_diagnostics_resolve_rate_pct\": 33.0,\n      \"diagnostic_lift_pp\": 6.0,\n      \"blind_lift_pp\": 2.5,\n      \"diagnostic_specific_lift_pp\": 3.5,\n      \"n_initially_unresolved\": 146,\n      \"n_rerepair_triggered\": 92,\n      \"rerepair_success_with_diag_pct\": 25.0,\n      \"rerepair_success_without_diag_pct\": 13.0,\n      \"mcnemar_pvalue\": 0.022,\n      \"multi_f2p_diagnostic_lift_pp\": 11.5,\n      \"single_f2p_diagnostic_lift_pp\": 2.0,\n      \"multi_f2p_n_instances\": 62,\n      \"single_f2p_n_instances\": 138,\n      \"avg_rerepair_attempts\": 1.8,\n      \"per_test_prediction_accuracy_on_tested\": 84.2\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Diagnostic Re-repair Results\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Condition\",\n          \"Resolve Rate\",\n          \"Δ vs Baseline\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"No re-repair (baseline)\",\n            \"27.0%\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Re-repair without diagnostics\",\n            \"29.5%\",\n            \"+2.5 pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Re-repair with per-test diagnostics\",\n            \"33.0%\",\n            \"+6.0 pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Diagnostic-specific lift\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"+3.5 pp (p=0.022)\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Diagnostic Lift Stratified by F2P Count\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"F2P Count\",\n          \"N Instances\",\n          \"Diag Lift\",\n          \"Blind Lift\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"T=1\",\n            138,\n            \"+2.0 pp\",\n            \"+1.5 pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"T≥2\",\n            62,\n            \"+11.5 pp\",\n            \"+3.8 pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Overall\",\n            200,\n            \"+6.0 pp\",\n            \"+2.5 pp\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Re-repair实验完成了Claim 2的实证闭环：per-test classification不仅在accuracy上等价于trajectory （TOST p=0.007），还提供了actionable的diagnostic信息带来6pp resolve rate improvement。 Stratification连接Claim 2和Claim 3：advantage集中在multi-F2P instances（与oracle预测一致）， 为部署决策提供了清晰框架——在multi-F2P场景下per-test verification的ROI最高。 论文应定位为proof-of-concept，目标是展示mechanism而非claim SOTA repair performance。 200 instances是moderate sample size，sufficient for significance但reviewer可能要求larger scale—— frame为future work方向。\\n\\nDiagnostic lift 6.0pp（best tier范围[3,8]）的机制： (1) Per-test predictions为repair agent提供failure localization—— 当agent知道\\\"test_parse_edge_case fails but test_basic passes\\\"时， 修复集中在edge case logic而非盲目重试entire solution； (2) Blind re-repair（知道unresolved但不知哪个test fail）仍有2.5pp lift， 因为SWE-agent的retry本身就有correction概率—— 但diagnostic-specific增量3.5pp证明per-test信息的独特贡献； (3) 优势严重集中于multi-F2P instances： T≥2时lift 11.5pp vs T=1时仅2.0pp，与oracle analysis预测完全一致。 原因：T=1时per-test info等价于trajectory info（只有一个fail test， 知道\\\"有test fail\\\"和知道\\\"test_X fail\\\"信息量相同）； T≥2时per-test info区分了不同failure patterns， repair agent可以逐个target failing tests而非guess which test fails。 McNemar p=0.022在200样本下达到显著性（<0.05）—— 虽然样本量有限但足以支撑proof-of-concept级别的claim。 92/146 re-repair triggered表明63%的unresolved instances至少尝试了re-repair； with diagnostics的25% success rate vs without的13%证明信息质量差异。 Per-test prediction accuracy on re-repair测试的84.2%与overall 85.5%接近， 说明re-repair并未选择性地作用于easy/hard cases。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":625,"startLine":1,"totalLines":625}}}
